<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Hi All<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:5.25pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Th=
is is the weekly test report for Yocto 1.3 20120530 build. QA tested all QE=
MUs and BSPs, as well as ADT. There are 3 new issues found in this build, o=
ne issue for BSPs, syslog is not started
 by default in background on emenlow/sugarbay/n450/crownbay, the other two =
for ADT, Glxgears failed on qemux86/x86-64/arm/mips/ppc on Ubuntu 11.10 64b=
it, it blocked some cases about clutter, Generate meta-toolchain by 'bitbak=
e meta-toolchain' missing libcurl.so.4.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:5.25pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">X =
start failed on eMenlow which blocked many cases, report as 2507 last week =
, and we upload the log for it. Other features perform well.<span style=3D"=
color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:5.25pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US">No=
te: The test report is archived @
<a href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.3_Weekly_Test_Report"=
>https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_1.3_Weekly_Test_Report</a><o:p></=
o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o=
:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;fo=
nt-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Test Summary:<o:p></o:p=
></span></b></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;fo=
